source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A heading level Jira has none of opens no block: Jira keeps the line in the paragraph above it, and jiro folds it into the same paragraph without a warning, because nothing was lost.
